WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.870
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: AI for Reports and Letters.

2
00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:10.854
Build a report step by step with AI. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:19.497
Step one. Ask for an outline first. For example, a one-page report about recycling at school.

4
00:00:20.483 --> 00:00:26.122
Step two. Ask for one section at a time. This keeps each part clear and short.

5
00:00:27.117 --> 00:00:34.105
Step three. Edit. Add your own facts, names and numbers. The report must be about your real situation.

6
00:00:35.117 --> 00:00:40.137
Step four. Check the facts and the spelling, and make sure it sounds like you.

7
00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:45.126
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:45.426 --> 00:00:48.354
Ask AI for an outline of a report on your topic.

9
00:00:48.654 --> 00:00:51.652
Write the introduction with AI, then edit it.

10
00:00:51.952 --> 00:00:54.010
Add two real facts of your own.

11
00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:55.694
Well done!

